(2289075, 316818, 46468, '<td valign="top">Due to the small size of the photo it is really hard to judge the details well. Challenge submissions should be as large as legally allowed, longest side at 640 pixels, your''s is 432 x 323. The focus seems a little soft, esp. on the bear but hard to tell acurately due to the size of photo, and in my opinion the crop is too close on the riding toy, it makes me feel as if I am missing something by not seeing all of its face. Hope this helps and good luck</td>', 'Due to the small size of the photo it is really hard to judge the details well. Challenge submissions should be as large as legally allowed, longest side at 640 pixels, your''s is 432 x 323. The focus seems a little soft, esp. on the bear but hard to tell acurately due to the size of photo, and in my opinion the crop is too close on the riding toy, it makes me feel as if I am missing something by not seeing all of its face. Hope this helps and good luck', '2006-04-05 09:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
