(2291660, 313850, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so creative.  The composition of the old rough window, and even the face of the worn out little bear says exactly what you want to say: "Abandoned".   Very well done.  Should be ribboning in this challenge imo!  10</td>', 'This is so creative.  The composition of the old rough window, and even the face of the worn out little bear says exactly what you want to say: "Abandoned".   Very well done.  Should be ribboning in this challenge imo!  10', '2006-04-06 09:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291668, 316351, 18626, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture !</td>', 'Very nice picture !', '2006-04-06 09:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291820, 316570, 3102, '<td valign="top">You might want to take advantage of the full 150k submission size allowed at DPC.  Your shot is only 47K, and reds are the first things to be affected by nasty pixelation in compressed .jpgs.  The reds look pretty sketchy on this one for that reason.  I would have scored it much higher if those artifacts weren''t present.</td>', 'You might want to take advantage of the full 150k submission size allowed at DPC.  Your shot is only 47K, and reds are the first things to be affected by nasty pixelation in compressed .jpgs.  The reds look pretty sketchy on this one for that reason.  I would have scored it much higher if those artifacts weren''t present.', '2006-04-06 11:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291824, 314676, 3102, '<td valign="top">You might try some experiments with lighting to get a better effect.  For one, try moving the subject further from the wall... and see if you can bounce a flash off a ceiling.  Those are a couple ways you can avoid the nasty shadows :)</td>', 'You might try some experiments with lighting to get a better effect.  For one, try moving the subject further from the wall... and see if you can bounce a flash off a ceiling.  Those are a couple ways you can avoid the nasty shadows :)', '2006-04-06 11:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291830, 313933, 3102, '<td valign="top">A little sick and twisted.  I like it!</td>', 'A little sick and twisted.  I like it!', '2006-04-06 11:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291839, 313566, 3102, '<td valign="top">A neat idea, but there are a few things that could have been executed better.  The lighting is a bit harsh -- try bouncing the flash off of something to avoid those hot spots.  The file size is only 33K-ish, which is why it looks so pixelated.  Learn to compress it so that it''s as close to the 150k as possible to avoid that.  And I''d probably ditch the blue border, in all honesty.  Not trying to sound like a jerk or anything with all of this, just some honest opinions on how you might improve upon a good idea :)</td>', 'A neat idea, but there are a few things that could have been executed better.  The lighting is a bit harsh -- try bouncing the flash off of something to avoid those hot spots.  The file size is only 33K-ish, which is why it looks so pixelated.  Learn to compress it so that it''s as close to the 150k as possible to avoid that.  And I''d probably ditch the blue border, in all honesty.  Not trying to sound like a jerk or anything with all of this, just some honest opinions on how you might improve upon a good idea :)', '2006-04-06 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
