(2292789, 315490, 51553, '<td valign="top">The yellowish hue from the lighting is detremental I think.  A whiter light would bring out the intensity of the red in contrast to the other colors.</td>', 'The yellowish hue from the lighting is detremental I think.  A whiter light would bring out the intensity of the red in contrast to the other colors.', '2006-04-06 20:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292792, 316600, 51553, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2006-04-06 20:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292793, 316782, 51553, '<td valign="top">A little too much USM perhaps</td>', 'A little too much USM perhaps', '2006-04-06 20:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292803, 316603, 51553, '<td valign="top">Awsome lighting.</td>', 'Awsome lighting.', '2006-04-06 20:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292821, 316396, 43828, '<td valign="top">wheres the rainbow?</td>', 'wheres the rainbow?', '2006-04-06 20:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292857, 315664, 43516, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2006-04-06 21:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292863, 315229, 43516, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I think it would be better if they were in an interesting patter or line instead of all jumbled up or if you got closer and minimized the jumble a bit.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I think it would be better if they were in an interesting patter or line instead of all jumbled up or if you got closer and minimized the jumble a bit.', '2006-04-06 21:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292886, 316610, 36078, '<td valign="top">Personally my fav.  Besides someone needing to clean the sensor I thought it was a very good idea.  I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Personally my fav.  Besides someone needing to clean the sensor I thought it was a very good idea.  I gave it a 10.', '2006-04-06 21:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292887, 313653, 36078, '<td valign="top">That is alot of lego heads.  When I was growing p they all just had one face.  I gave it a 9.</td>', 'That is alot of lego heads.  When I was growing p they all just had one face.  I gave it a 9.', '2006-04-06 21:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292889, 316905, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very nice Depth Of Field, and add''s to the overall effect.  Nice lighting and set of colors to also tie in with the movie.  I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Very nice Depth Of Field, and add''s to the overall effect.  Nice lighting and set of colors to also tie in with the movie.  I gave it a 9.', '2006-04-06 21:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292890, 313566, 43516, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but the reds are clipped.  There is no detail in the red part of the picture.</td>', 'Interesting idea but the reds are clipped.  There is no detail in the red part of the picture.', '2006-04-06 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292892, 316049, 36078, '<td valign="top">I laughed so hard.  Little bit on the small side for my likes but I gave it a 9.</td>', 'I laughed so hard.  Little bit on the small side for my likes but I gave it a 9.', '2006-04-06 21:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292893, 315459, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Nice crisp clear image.  And I do like the vertical tilt to everything.  I gave it a 8.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Nice crisp clear image.  And I do like the vertical tilt to everything.  I gave it a 8.', '2006-04-06 21:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292896, 314897, 43516, '<td valign="top">I guess they can read upside down? :-) Cute idea.</td>', 'I guess they can read upside down? :-) Cute idea.', '2006-04-06 21:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292906, 316161, 22301, '<td valign="top">i like this but i wish that cat wasnt coming down the stairs too. 6</td>', 'i like this but i wish that cat wasnt coming down the stairs too. 6', '2006-04-06 21:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292910, 315459, 22301, '<td valign="top">i think the colors and composiotin are really good, but i think it would have looked better in the regular view or maybe some angled crop</td>', 'i think the colors and composiotin are really good, but i think it would have looked better in the regular view or maybe some angled crop', '2006-04-06 21:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292920, 316762, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice compsition and color, bonus point for quoting Karl Hungus in the volkswagen commercials, 8</td>', 'nice compsition and color, bonus point for quoting Karl Hungus in the volkswagen commercials, 8', '2006-04-06 21:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293069, 315899, 52074, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I think this is tacky</td>', 'Sorry, but I think this is tacky', '2006-04-06 23:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293078, 316669, 41200, '<td valign="top">Eye contact, dramatic lighting, and subdued background. Well thought out!</td>', 'Eye contact, dramatic lighting, and subdued background. Well thought out!', '2006-04-06 23:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293084, 314785, 41200, '<td valign="top">Very nice "feel good" image and well executed.</td>', 'Very nice "feel good" image and well executed.', '2006-04-06 23:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293110, 315982, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting shot.. nice work. I love that you shot it in black and white.</td>', 'This is a really interesting shot.. nice work. I love that you shot it in black and white.', '2006-04-06 23:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293113, 316049, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a little scary lol.</td>', 'This is a little scary lol.', '2006-04-06 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293118, 314785, 32633, '<td valign="top">The coloring in this shot is beautiful.. nice work. I love the scenery.</td>', 'The coloring in this shot is beautiful.. nice work. I love the scenery.', '2006-04-06 23:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293163, 315149, 33392, '<td valign="top">The two solders up close that are not in focus are too dominating (in the picture - can''t say regarding the battle ).  It is hard to make yourself focus on the next line of solders, where your focal target is.</td>', 'The two solders up close that are not in focus are too dominating (in the picture - can''t say regarding the battle ).  It is hard to make yourself focus on the next line of solders, where your focal target is.', '2006-04-06 23:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293192, 316692, 43516, '<td valign="top">Thats awesome!</td>', 'Thats awesome!', '2006-04-07 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293204, 315459, 43516, '<td valign="top">I''d like this a lot better if it wasn''t turned sideways.  I really like the colors and the mottion.</td>', 'I''d like this a lot better if it wasn''t turned sideways.  I really like the colors and the mottion.', '2006-04-07 00:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293220, 314785, 52500, '<td valign="top">This one should win in my opinion; your title suits the picture perfectly!  Great capture!</td>', 'This one should win in my opinion; your title suits the picture perfectly!  Great capture!', '2006-04-07 00:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293309, 316733, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww. . .how creatively done!  What a fun, happy image.   I love the colors you''ve used -- so vivid and contrasting!   This is one of my favorites!    I sure hope this one does well.  It deserves to!!!</td>', 'Awwwwww. . .how creatively done!  What a fun, happy image.   I love the colors you''ve used -- so vivid and contrasting!   This is one of my favorites!    I sure hope this one does well.  It deserves to!!!', '2006-04-07 01:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2293541, 314785, 37893, '<td valign="top">Love this! Great colors!</td>', 'Love this! Great colors!', '2006-04-07 02:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
