(2293837, 316692, 42601, '<td valign="top">There is something to the very right of the yo-yo that shows it''s being held up. Is there??? He he he... I might be wrong. Either or, I like the shot, but wouldve liked to see a tad more spin or movement on the yo-yo. The DOF is outstanding. It''s truly a good shot nonetheless.</td>', 'There is something to the very right of the yo-yo that shows it''s being held up. Is there??? He he he... I might be wrong. Either or, I like the shot, but wouldve liked to see a tad more spin or movement on the yo-yo. The DOF is outstanding. It''s truly a good shot nonetheless.', '2006-04-07 03:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
