(2293938, 316537, 42601, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the execution. although I feel the background doesn;t suit the light from the side at all. If the background picture was lit a little bit more, the light from the side wouldn''t have distracted from the main picture so much. Also, the smoke is very well done, seriously, but the fact that the wheels are so stationary is also not helping. I wouldve maybe looked at putting grass and twigs in the foreground to hide the wheels a little and make it seems as if it''s pastures he is moving through. Besides that, good shot and good luck for the next challenge! :)</td>', 'Good idea for the execution. although I feel the background doesn;t suit the light from the side at all. If the background picture was lit a little bit more, the light from the side wouldn''t have distracted from the main picture so much. Also, the smoke is very well done, seriously, but the fact that the wheels are so stationary is also not helping. I wouldve maybe looked at putting grass and twigs in the foreground to hide the wheels a little and make it seems as if it''s pastures he is moving through. Besides that, good shot and good luck for the next challenge! :)', '2006-04-07 03:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
