(2293950, 314447, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, although I find two things a little disturbing. One, the content of the fridge - the jam and butter couldve gone and secondly I wouldve maybe come up with the shot a little more the get a better shot of your hero in this picture. Good luck with the next challenge!</td>', 'Nice idea, although I find two things a little disturbing. One, the content of the fridge - the jam and butter couldve gone and secondly I wouldve maybe come up with the shot a little more the get a better shot of your hero in this picture. Good luck with the next challenge!', '2006-04-07 03:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
