(2294282, 316599, 48298, '<td valign="top">ROFL!  I was getting ready to give you a one if Barbie had been naked doing something obscene, but this is very funny.  Very well done.  10!!!</td>', 'ROFL!  I was getting ready to give you a one if Barbie had been naked doing something obscene, but this is very funny.  Very well done.  10!!!', '2006-04-07 06:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
