(2294314, 316382, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice background and styling however I feel the doll''s face is a little too exposed on the left hand side. Still, good shot and good luck with the next challenge!</td>', 'Nice background and styling however I feel the doll''s face is a little too exposed on the left hand side. Still, good shot and good luck with the next challenge!', '2006-04-07 06:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
