(2294319, 316910, 42601, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!! One niggle and I''m sure you are gonna hear it a lot - the string... Pity you couldn'';t use the cloning tool :) <br/> <br/>Could it have worked to tie the string to his hands? That way, it wouldve looked like web swinging?<br/> <br/>Anyhow, great pic nonetheless!</td>', 'Very nice shot!! One niggle and I''m sure you are gonna hear it a lot - the string... Pity you couldn'';t use the cloning tool :)  Could it have worked to tie the string to his hands? That way, it wouldve looked like web swinging? Anyhow, great pic nonetheless!', '2006-04-07 06:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294320, 316760, 48298, '<td valign="top">I love the sepia.  Nice tones and great detail.</td>', 'I love the sepia.  Nice tones and great detail.', '2006-04-07 06:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294321, 313975, 42601, '<td valign="top">Very nicely styled, I like the blue light, however, the doll on the right doesnt seem to be as sharp as I wouldve personally liked her to be. She couldbe maybe also been positioned to look into the globe rather than over it. Still, a good shot worthy of merit.</td>', 'Very nicely styled, I like the blue light, however, the doll on the right doesnt seem to be as sharp as I wouldve personally liked her to be. She couldbe maybe also been positioned to look into the globe rather than over it. Still, a good shot worthy of merit.', '2006-04-07 06:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294323, 315936, 48298, '<td valign="top">Good eye!  Don''t you have a garage?  ;)  Nice bright color.</td>', 'Good eye!  Don''t you have a garage?  ;)  Nice bright color.', '2006-04-07 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294325, 314097, 48298, '<td valign="top">I like how you angled this...interesting composition with the horse rug.</td>', 'I like how you angled this...interesting composition with the horse rug.', '2006-04-07 06:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294327, 316389, 42601, '<td valign="top">I love foosball! Cool to have gotten the camera at that angle. I can''t imagine a DSLR going in the to shoot that; save if the side panels are removed. :) Anyhow, I know foosball but I am wondering whether other people might also know? You shot cuts the players off so it may not be enough to convince someone that it''s table soccer. I would also have maybe looked at getting the player on the left more in focus or crisp for that matter. Good shot!</td>', 'I love foosball! Cool to have gotten the camera at that angle. I can''t imagine a DSLR going in the to shoot that; save if the side panels are removed. :) Anyhow, I know foosball but I am wondering whether other people might also know? You shot cuts the players off so it may not be enough to convince someone that it''s table soccer. I would also have maybe looked at getting the player on the left more in focus or crisp for that matter. Good shot!', '2006-04-07 06:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294329, 316895, 48298, '<td valign="top">Cute perspective and I like the baby''s silly facial expression.  Brings back memories, too.  Now I want another baby.  LOL.  10.</td>', 'Cute perspective and I like the baby''s silly facial expression.  Brings back memories, too.  Now I want another baby.  LOL.  10.', '2006-04-07 06:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294330, 316771, 42601, '<td valign="top">I love Peanuts! This setup is great, although I think you may have oversharpened a little bit too much. Also, the flowers on the right hand side could maybe do with a crop, I dont feel it lends to the overall picture. Well done nonetheless!!</td>', 'I love Peanuts! This setup is great, although I think you may have oversharpened a little bit too much. Also, the flowers on the right hand side could maybe do with a crop, I dont feel it lends to the overall picture. Well done nonetheless!!', '2006-04-07 06:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294333, 316720, 48298, '<td valign="top">This has nice shine and detail, but the composition feels a bit off to me.  I think I would have liked the stacked object to be fully in the frame, or maybe moved to the right a bit.  Good concept, though.</td>', 'This has nice shine and detail, but the composition feels a bit off to me.  I think I would have liked the stacked object to be fully in the frame, or maybe moved to the right a bit.  Good concept, though.', '2006-04-07 06:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294334, 316635, 42601, '<td valign="top">I see what you tried to do with this shot, but I think the dull colouring detract from its message. (For me at least :)) Maybe do a little more saturation as well as contrast to try and lift the sky from the beach and also get a bit more depth to the photo. It feels very flat to me. Good luck with the next challenge! :)</td>', 'I see what you tried to do with this shot, but I think the dull colouring detract from its message. (For me at least :)) Maybe do a little more saturation as well as contrast to try and lift the sky from the beach and also get a bit more depth to the photo. It feels very flat to me. Good luck with the next challenge! :)', '2006-04-07 06:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294337, 314280, 42601, '<td valign="top">Technically I wouldnt say there is anything wrong with this shot, but it''s the story it''s trying to tell thats a little ''mundane'' in a challenge littered with  some exciting and styled scenario''s.</td>', 'Technically I wouldnt say there is anything wrong with this shot, but it''s the story it''s trying to tell thats a little ''mundane'' in a challenge littered with  some exciting and styled scenario''s.', '2006-04-07 06:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294338, 314343, 48298, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice sharp focus on the toy.  I think it may have been better if you straightened the horizon.</td>', 'Good idea and nice sharp focus on the toy.  I think it may have been better if you straightened the horizon.', '2006-04-07 06:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294339, 316397, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and picture.</td>', 'Nice lighting and picture.', '2006-04-07 06:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294341, 316514, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice pose but the picture is very soft and it seems a tad out of focus. Also, the carpet tends to make the shot a little bit ''dull'' in terms of background. Top of my head I would just imagine this pose on grass already better. Or maybe next to a pool to get some blue in the shot. Think of backgrounds - they lend almost 80% to your subjects in most cases! :) Good luck with the next challenge!</td>', 'Nice pose but the picture is very soft and it seems a tad out of focus. Also, the carpet tends to make the shot a little bit ''dull'' in terms of background. Top of my head I would just imagine this pose on grass already better. Or maybe next to a pool to get some blue in the shot. Think of backgrounds - they lend almost 80% to your subjects in most cases! :) Good luck with the next challenge!', '2006-04-07 06:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294342, 316820, 42601, '<td valign="top">Love the sillhoette, love the shot. The metal bars by his legs are a little bit distracting but that couldnt be helped. Good work! :)</td>', 'Love the sillhoette, love the shot. The metal bars by his legs are a little bit distracting but that couldnt be helped. Good work! :)', '2006-04-07 06:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294361, 314655, 48298, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and I like that Boardwalk and the hotel are blurred and the car is sharp.</td>', 'Great idea, and I like that Boardwalk and the hotel are blurred and the car is sharp.', '2006-04-07 07:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294364, 316890, 48298, '<td valign="top">Cute!  I like how the baby is turned away from the camera.  Good title, too.  Well done.</td>', 'Cute!  I like how the baby is turned away from the camera.  Good title, too.  Well done.', '2006-04-07 07:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294365, 316900, 48298, '<td valign="top">Nice positioning on the larger tire.  I bet somebody loved this truck once...you?  :)</td>', 'Nice positioning on the larger tire.  I bet somebody loved this truck once...you?  :)', '2006-04-07 07:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294367, 314785, 48298, '<td valign="top">Smart title.  Lovely greens and reflection!</td>', 'Smart title.  Lovely greens and reflection!', '2006-04-07 07:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294428, 316007, 31820, '<td valign="top">Top Notch, BUZ,<br/>My Favouite!</td>', 'Top Notch, BUZ,My Favouite!', '2006-04-07 08:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294434, 316820, 46885, '<td valign="top">I reckon you could give us a bit of the foreground without making sacrifice of the silouette. The image is sort of overall dark without actual merit.</td>', 'I reckon you could give us a bit of the foreground without making sacrifice of the silouette. The image is sort of overall dark without actual merit.', '2006-04-07 08:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294456, 313588, 46885, '<td valign="top">Hm, flying things are in a bit of mismatch with the placid face of the kid. And sharpness isn''t the strongest point. That said, the concept and the balance of this shot is quite nice.</td>', 'Hm, flying things are in a bit of mismatch with the placid face of the kid. And sharpness isn''t the strongest point. That said, the concept and the balance of this shot is quite nice.', '2006-04-07 08:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294473, 316688, 53964, '<td valign="top">Is that...NODDY?! :D</td>', 'Is that...NODDY?! :D', '2006-04-07 08:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294478, 315962, 53964, '<td valign="top">Oh my, I WANT this doll for my halloween display!</td>', 'Oh my, I WANT this doll for my halloween display!', '2006-04-07 08:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294520, 316061, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2006-04-07 09:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294521, 315147, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2006-04-07 09:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294527, 316245, 55840, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  Would have given it a higher score if it was a little brighter on the colors.</td>', 'Neat idea.  Would have given it a higher score if it was a little brighter on the colors.', '2006-04-07 09:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294538, 316902, 55840, '<td valign="top">A lot of noise which I know can''t really be edited out in this challenge.  Neat idea though.  Wish it could have had a touch more color though but then again then you wouldn''t be getting the backlight affect so....?</td>', 'A lot of noise which I know can''t really be edited out in this challenge.  Neat idea though.  Wish it could have had a touch more color though but then again then you wouldn''t be getting the backlight affect so....?', '2006-04-07 09:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294550, 316890, 55840, '<td valign="top">Would have rated it higher if the baby wouldn''t have been positioned so dead center.  Try playing around with rule of thirds.  Love the color and the lighting technique.</td>', 'Would have rated it higher if the baby wouldn''t have been positioned so dead center.  Try playing around with rule of thirds.  Love the color and the lighting technique.', '2006-04-07 09:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294558, 313850, 55840, '<td valign="top">Like how you tilted the camera to show a different angle on the subject.  If this would have been a straight on shot wouldn''t have done anything for me but because of the tilt it has great leading lines.</td>', 'Like how you tilted the camera to show a different angle on the subject.  If this would have been a straight on shot wouldn''t have done anything for me but because of the tilt it has great leading lines.', '2006-04-07 09:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294564, 316369, 55840, '<td valign="top">Ok maybe its because I am obsessed with hands....but I love this shot.  Good detail and color choice.</td>', 'Ok maybe its because I am obsessed with hands....but I love this shot.  Good detail and color choice.', '2006-04-07 09:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294566, 315970, 46885, '<td valign="top">I''d rather you use some panning instead of keeping background static and subjects blurred.</td>', 'I''d rather you use some panning instead of keeping background static and subjects blurred.', '2006-04-07 09:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294569, 315459, 55840, '<td valign="top">I keep trying to turn the picture.  I know that you were trying to make it look like a downward spin but personally I would have rated it higher if the picture was going the correct way.  I like the idea though.</td>', 'I keep trying to turn the picture.  I know that you were trying to make it look like a downward spin but personally I would have rated it higher if the picture was going the correct way.  I like the idea though.', '2006-04-07 09:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294571, 316223, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very nice leading lines.  Love the colorized train vs the b/w of everything else.  Generally I do not like titled things but I think it works very well here.  I have you an 8 and good luck.</td>', 'Very nice leading lines.  Love the colorized train vs the b/w of everything else.  Generally I do not like titled things but I think it works very well here.  I have you an 8 and good luck.', '2006-04-07 09:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294573, 315042, 55840, '<td valign="top">My eye keeps going to the line down the back...was this intentional to try splitting them or just happened to be there?  Either way for me it is a little distracting.  Nice clear shot though...good details on them.</td>', 'My eye keeps going to the line down the back...was this intentional to try splitting them or just happened to be there?  Either way for me it is a little distracting.  Nice clear shot though...good details on them.', '2006-04-07 09:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294576, 316610, 55840, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh!  Love the idea.</td>', 'Made me laugh!  Love the idea.', '2006-04-07 09:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294582, 316798, 55840, '<td valign="top">Little blown out on the horses nose...no seperation between it and the background.  But the idea is cute and the children are adorable!</td>', 'Little blown out on the horses nose...no seperation between it and the background.  But the idea is cute and the children are adorable!', '2006-04-07 09:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294583, 316820, 55840, '<td valign="top">Love the silloute.  Great job.</td>', 'Love the silloute.  Great job.', '2006-04-07 09:43:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2294615, 316708, 55840, '<td valign="top">Not sure the picture would have quite done it for me without that title.  Good lighting and composition.  Great creative thought.</td>', 'Not sure the picture would have quite done it for me without that title.  Good lighting and composition.  Great creative thought.', '2006-04-07 10:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294732, 315664, 56812, '<td valign="top">Very clever! The resemblance is uncanny.</td>', 'Very clever! The resemblance is uncanny.', '2006-04-07 10:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294794, 313933, 56312, '<td valign="top">Great photo. My favourite</td>', 'Great photo. My favourite', '2006-04-07 11:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294959, 316671, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great job! ...in a sick way. :)</td>', 'Great job! ...in a sick way. :)', '2006-04-07 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294964, 316909, 28742, '<td valign="top">If I see what I think I see, the title would fit better if the car faced the opposite direction. ;-)</td>', 'If I see what I think I see, the title would fit better if the car faced the opposite direction. ;-)', '2006-04-07 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294986, 316610, 28742, '<td valign="top">Love it! Would''ve given an extra point for the original house in the background.</td>', 'Love it! Would''ve given an extra point for the original house in the background.', '2006-04-07 12:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294993, 314344, 28742, '<td valign="top">Subtle. ;-)</td>', 'Subtle. ;-)', '2006-04-07 12:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295013, 316351, 28742, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Scalvert. Excellent idea, great execution.</td>', 'This looks like a Scalvert. Excellent idea, great execution.', '2006-04-07 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295020, 316810, 28742, '<td valign="top">I love it! And I''ll give them their favorite score... ;-)</td>', 'I love it! And I''ll give them their favorite score... ;-)', '2006-04-07 12:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295055, 316885, 39349, '<td valign="top">Creative and colorful, excellent focus and composition is good. Only thing that I notice is that the edge of the flower and part of the face seem a bit hot. Other than that this is a great shot that meets the challenge perfectly. Well done.<br/> <br/>And yes, this is not "ugly!" ;)</td>', 'Creative and colorful, excellent focus and composition is good. Only thing that I notice is that the edge of the flower and part of the face seem a bit hot. Other than that this is a great shot that meets the challenge perfectly. Well done. And yes, this is not "ugly!" ;)', '2006-04-07 13:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295065, 315422, 39349, '<td valign="top">This is FREAKING AWESOME! It has some real twilight zone overtones to it. If I''m way off base I''m sorry but I do love this shot, technically it''s perfect IMHO in every way. 10 from me for a well composed shot that creates real emotion in the viewer.</td>', 'This is FREAKING AWESOME! It has some real twilight zone overtones to it. If I''m way off base I''m sorry but I do love this shot, technically it''s perfect IMHO in every way. 10 from me for a well composed shot that creates real emotion in the viewer.', '2006-04-07 13:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295169, 315299, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture in that lighting situation, well done!</td>', 'Good capture in that lighting situation, well done!', '2006-04-07 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295197, 316630, 26246, '<td valign="top">i really like it</td>', 'i really like it', '2006-04-07 13:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295245, 316909, 43594, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!!!</td>', 'Nice idea!!!', '2006-04-07 14:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295250, 313933, 43594, '<td valign="top">Nice approach, nice DOF</td>', 'Nice approach, nice DOF', '2006-04-07 14:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295284, 313794, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but where''s the whisker stubble? Seriously, very creative.<br/>Edit- Bump to 9</td>', 'Nice try, but where''s the whisker stubble? Seriously, very creative.Edit- Bump to 9', '2006-04-07 14:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295296, 314443, 40370, '<td valign="top">The yellow background doesn''t work for me, maybe red (traditional Mickey color) or a blue tone that compliements the color of the fabric. Nice angle, but I would''ve cropped out the thing at the bottom. Bump for the mouse, 8</td>', 'The yellow background doesn''t work for me, maybe red (traditional Mickey color) or a blue tone that compliements the color of the fabric. Nice angle, but I would''ve cropped out the thing at the bottom. Bump for the mouse, 8', '2006-04-07 14:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295312, 316006, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea as eyes are good subjects.  Sharper focus and not-so-central composition would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea as eyes are good subjects.  Sharper focus and not-so-central composition would be better.', '2006-04-07 14:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295430, 316688, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and DOF to really make this toy pop.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Great lighting and DOF to really make this toy pop.  Very nicely done!', '2006-04-07 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295435, 316671, 42100, '<td valign="top">I don''t think Hollywood itself, could of come up with a creepier and scarier image than this.  Great execution on your part and a great photo!</td>', 'I don''t think Hollywood itself, could of come up with a creepier and scarier image than this.  Great execution on your part and a great photo!', '2006-04-07 16:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295437, 314785, 42100, '<td valign="top">Amazing color and contrast.  It''s a small nitpick, but I would of liked to of seen the bear turned so he''s looking more into the frame, his glance seems to lead me out of the photo.</td>', 'Amazing color and contrast.  It''s a small nitpick, but I would of liked to of seen the bear turned so he''s looking more into the frame, his glance seems to lead me out of the photo.', '2006-04-07 16:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295439, 315147, 42100, '<td valign="top">Inclusion of the person in soft focus really makes this photo great.  Well done!</td>', 'Inclusion of the person in soft focus really makes this photo great.  Well done!', '2006-04-07 16:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295472, 313793, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Wished the corners were in focus/greater DOF.</td>', 'Nice composition. Wished the corners were in focus/greater DOF.', '2006-04-07 16:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295476, 316854, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Maybe higher contrast would be better.</td>', 'Nice photo. Maybe higher contrast would be better.', '2006-04-07 16:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295479, 316199, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, like the antique look.</td>', 'Nice composition, like the antique look.', '2006-04-07 16:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295485, 315848, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Like the composition.</td>', 'Very nice. Like the composition.', '2006-04-07 16:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295564, 316190, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice encouraging idea, pretty good composition.  Too bad it suffers from so much motion blur.  Bump up ISO and shutter speed to stop motion.</td>', 'Nice encouraging idea, pretty good composition.  Too bad it suffers from so much motion blur.  Bump up ISO and shutter speed to stop motion.', '2006-04-07 17:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295568, 313742, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but image is just too small to see anything.  Please see <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a></td>', 'Nice idea, but image is just too small to see anything.  Please see tutorial', '2006-04-07 17:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295569, 314230, 44490, '<td valign="top">Seems like it might be interesting, but image is just too small to see much.  Please see <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a></td>', 'Seems like it might be interesting, but image is just too small to see much.  Please see tutorial', '2006-04-07 17:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295575, 316235, 44490, '<td valign="top">Could be a cute bear, but I can''t tell.  Is this post-processing run amok or are you trying for the brown?</td>', 'Could be a cute bear, but I can''t tell.  Is this post-processing run amok or are you trying for the brown?', '2006-04-07 17:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295617, 313938, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Image is just too dark, please check your levels and consider lighting Yoda''s face at least.  If you could rig up a lit light saber with fiber optics or something, that would really help.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Image is just too dark, please check your levels and consider lighting Yoda''s face at least.  If you could rig up a lit light saber with fiber optics or something, that would really help.', '2006-04-07 17:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295645, 316215, 56826, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image....really nice,</td>', 'Wonderful image....really nice,', '2006-04-07 17:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295651, 315019, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and colors.  DOF to include Play-Doh would be better, especially since it is so prominent in the foreground, and in composition and title.</td>', 'Nice arrangement and colors.  DOF to include Play-Doh would be better, especially since it is so prominent in the foreground, and in composition and title.', '2006-04-07 17:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295658, 316623, 43565, '<td valign="top">I wish the lego was more in focus.</td>', 'I wish the lego was more in focus.', '2006-04-07 17:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295666, 315693, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute kid and action pose.  You''re exactly on the edge of a shadow, if the subject were 1 foot to your right, it would get illumination from the sun.  More face and focus on face would be better, focus appears to be on pants.</td>', 'Cute kid and action pose.  You''re exactly on the edge of a shadow, if the subject were 1 foot to your right, it would get illumination from the sun.  More face and focus on face would be better, focus appears to be on pants.', '2006-04-07 17:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295675, 316366, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition.  Image just feels drab, brighter levels and a touch more saturation would help.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition.  Image just feels drab, brighter levels and a touch more saturation would help.', '2006-04-07 17:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295685, 313748, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.  Focus on foreground and more DOF would help a lot.  Otherwise, the image is interesting, cute, and colorful, and could have been great.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.  Focus on foreground and more DOF would help a lot.  Otherwise, the image is interesting, cute, and colorful, and could have been great.', '2006-04-07 17:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295700, 316892, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.  Lighting other than direct flash would be better, at least try bounce or diffusion, or move on to separate lighting from both sides.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.  Lighting other than direct flash would be better, at least try bounce or diffusion, or move on to separate lighting from both sides.', '2006-04-07 17:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295704, 315930, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.  Subject is lost against the background.  Contrasting seemless background and better lighting would help.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.  Subject is lost against the background.  Contrasting seemless background and better lighting would help.', '2006-04-07 17:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295708, 315086, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, cute, and colorful.  Image just suffers from poor lighting.  Move on from direct flash to at least bounce and/or diffusion, separate off-camera lighting would be even better.</td>', 'Nice idea, cute, and colorful.  Image just suffers from poor lighting.  Move on from direct flash to at least bounce and/or diffusion, separate off-camera lighting would be even better.', '2006-04-07 17:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295738, 316609, 44490, '<td valign="top">Could have been a good idea if you put a childrens game on the screen, and maybe added a game controller.</td>', 'Could have been a good idea if you put a childrens game on the screen, and maybe added a game controller.', '2006-04-07 18:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295752, 316884, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for subject arrangement.  Grainy high-contrast image might be artsy, but it just can''t compensate for loss of image detail.  More detail would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea for subject arrangement.  Grainy high-contrast image might be artsy, but it just can''t compensate for loss of image detail.  More detail would be better.', '2006-04-07 18:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
