(2296532, 316170, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.  More saturation would be better to compensate for partial exposure, and a plain background surface would eliminate the odd texturing effect.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.  More saturation would be better to compensate for partial exposure, and a plain background surface would eliminate the odd texturing effect.', '2006-04-07 23:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296535, 316323, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and colors.  I think that more DOF would help it look sharper and better.</td>', 'Nice idea and colors.  I think that more DOF would help it look sharper and better.', '2006-04-07 23:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296536, 316183, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range.  Composition is superb.</td>', 'Great tonal range.  Composition is superb.', '2006-04-07 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296543, 316859, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Focus more toward front and more DOF would help.  Nice colors appear somewhat yellowed/muted, perhaps by tungsten lighting - try auto levels or adjusting white balance or hue, and try punching up saturation.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Focus more toward front and more DOF would help.  Nice colors appear somewhat yellowed/muted, perhaps by tungsten lighting - try auto levels or adjusting white balance or hue, and try punching up saturation.', '2006-04-07 23:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296551, 314676, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and colors.  Keep doll further away from background to soften the overly hard shadows.  Less-central and less-straight-on composition would be better.</td>', 'Nice clarity and colors.  Keep doll further away from background to soften the overly hard shadows.  Less-central and less-straight-on composition would be better.', '2006-04-08 00:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296556, 316761, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice model car.  Angled composition would be more interesting, also consider one less doll, plain background, and lighting from both sides.</td>', 'Nice model car.  Angled composition would be more interesting, also consider one less doll, plain background, and lighting from both sides.', '2006-04-08 00:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296557, 316511, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, arrangement, and composition.  Image just suffers from harsh on-camera flash lighting.  For a set shot, multiple off-camera lights would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea, arrangement, and composition.  Image just suffers from harsh on-camera flash lighting.  For a set shot, multiple off-camera lights would be better.', '2006-04-08 00:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296598, 316844, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, lighting, sharpness, DOF.  It''s a little busy, fewer dinosaurs would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea, lighting, sharpness, DOF.  It''s a little busy, fewer dinosaurs would be better.', '2006-04-08 00:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296618, 316755, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, composition.  After conversion to B&amp;W, please revisit the levels.  Brighter levels and/or brightness/contrast adjustment would be better.  The action capture is great.</td>', 'Nice capture, composition.  After conversion to B&W, please revisit the levels.  Brighter levels and/or brightness/contrast adjustment would be better.  The action capture is great.', '2006-04-08 00:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296627, 313653, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and kept me looking.  Wish there were an obvious point of final focus, like putting the orange pumpkin more toward the center with orange color cranked up nearly to florescence, and maybe cropped to fewer minifigs.</td>', 'Nice idea, and kept me looking.  Wish there were an obvious point of final focus, like putting the orange pumpkin more toward the center with orange color cranked up nearly to florescence, and maybe cropped to fewer minifigs.', '2006-04-08 00:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296682, 314840, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, use of fish eye, desaturation.  Looks like backfocus a few feet behind the subjects feet, the sand looks sharp behind and on the lower right, but the main subjects are too soft.  I still like the image, its story, and feel.</td>', 'Nice composition, use of fish eye, desaturation.  Looks like backfocus a few feet behind the subjects feet, the sand looks sharp behind and on the lower right, but the main subjects are too soft.  I still like the image, its story, and feel.', '2006-04-08 01:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296698, 315826, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, love the big tough guy on the little bike.  Less DOF would be better to blur out the distracting cars in the background, yet retain the nice tree colors.</td>', 'Nice idea, love the big tough guy on the little bike.  Less DOF would be better to blur out the distracting cars in the background, yet retain the nice tree colors.', '2006-04-08 01:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296703, 316692, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Crop touching edge is a little too tight, I can guess that it is necessary for this "magic."  More DOF would be better in my opinion, if you could keep the background from becoming distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Crop touching edge is a little too tight, I can guess that it is necessary for this "magic."  More DOF would be better in my opinion, if you could keep the background from becoming distracting.', '2006-04-08 01:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296708, 316883, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition.  Wish for more illumination on the face/head.</td>', 'Nice subject and composition.  Wish for more illumination on the face/head.', '2006-04-08 01:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296731, 316683, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Wish for a plainer background with contrast so that the bear stands out more.  Cute.  Update --&gt; wish you had mirror reversed the image left-right and titled it "Teddy Bear''s Self-Portrait," -- I think that would have connected with most of us photogs with a big smile.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Wish for a plainer background with contrast so that the bear stands out more.  Cute.  Update --> wish you had mirror reversed the image left-right and titled it "Teddy Bear''s Self-Portrait," -- I think that would have connected with most of us photogs with a big smile.', '2006-04-08 01:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296746, 316585, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, cute child, nice soft feel and colors.  Wish that the bear''s face were visible.</td>', 'Nice composition, cute child, nice soft feel and colors.  Wish that the bear''s face were visible.', '2006-04-08 01:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296757, 316688, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colors, and background.  DOF to include front of car would be better in my opinion, as it is front and center.</td>', 'Nice composition, colors, and background.  DOF to include front of car would be better in my opinion, as it is front and center.', '2006-04-08 01:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296758, 316760, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, feel, emotive.  After conversion to duotone, please revisit the levels and/or brightness contrast.  Brighter levels would be better, as image is too midtone.</td>', 'Nice idea, feel, emotive.  After conversion to duotone, please revisit the levels and/or brightness contrast.  Brighter levels would be better, as image is too midtone.', '2006-04-08 01:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296770, 314226, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely and interesting pastel look and feel.  Wish for a touch more contrast as just a little too much detail and clarity has been lost, especially on the fairies.</td>', 'Lovely and interesting pastel look and feel.  Wish for a touch more contrast as just a little too much detail and clarity has been lost, especially on the fairies.', '2006-04-08 02:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296775, 316396, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, arrangement, great expressions made me smile.  Fewer strongmen and plain background would be better, as the image is too busy, but those faces carry the vote.</td>', 'Good idea, arrangement, great expressions made me smile.  Fewer strongmen and plain background would be better, as the image is too busy, but those faces carry the vote.', '2006-04-08 02:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296776, 316063, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good setup, exposure, background, and colors.  More lighting on face, more DOF, and slightly less-central composition would be better.</td>', 'Good setup, exposure, background, and colors.  More lighting on face, more DOF, and slightly less-central composition would be better.', '2006-04-08 02:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296778, 316351, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and pretty good execution.  Fewer backs and more DOF to include foreground would be better.  I really like that you told a story with the toys.</td>', 'Nice idea, and pretty good execution.  Fewer backs and more DOF to include foreground would be better.  I really like that you told a story with the toys.', '2006-04-08 02:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296779, 316397, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, exposure, lovely doll.  While warm hue has a nice old feeling, I think that brighter levels would help bring out the lace, pearls, and hat.</td>', 'Nice composition, exposure, lovely doll.  While warm hue has a nice old feeling, I think that brighter levels would help bring out the lace, pearls, and hat.', '2006-04-08 02:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296780, 316329, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute kids, poses, expressions, nice exposure.  In my opinion, trunk/truck isn''t enough to tie in the kids.  It looks like you have snow -- snowballs in hand and snow in the truck might have done it, spectacularly.</td>', 'Cute kids, poses, expressions, nice exposure.  In my opinion, trunk/truck isn''t enough to tie in the kids.  It looks like you have snow -- snowballs in hand and snow in the truck might have done it, spectacularly.', '2006-04-08 02:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296781, 316395, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, arrangement, composition, desaturation.  Plain background would really help.</td>', 'Nice pose, arrangement, composition, desaturation.  Plain background would really help.', '2006-04-08 02:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296785, 316537, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good smoke, background, composition.  Just wish for more illumination on face of train, but I love the shot.</td>', 'Nice idea, good smoke, background, composition.  Just wish for more illumination on face of train, but I love the shot.', '2006-04-08 02:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296787, 316696, 44490, '<td valign="top">Too funny.  Good composition, colors.  More DOF and sharpness on Homer would be better, but the humor carries the image nicely.</td>', 'Too funny.  Good composition, colors.  More DOF and sharpness on Homer would be better, but the humor carries the image nicely.', '2006-04-08 02:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296790, 316720, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely collection of wooden toys.  I''d prefer more DOF so that I could see all of the toys.  Wood can be so beautiful, and you show some of that here.</td>', 'Lovely collection of wooden toys.  I''d prefer more DOF so that I could see all of the toys.  Wood can be so beautiful, and you show some of that here.', '2006-04-08 02:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296791, 316586, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice diorama.  Wish figures were closer and larger.  Image looks a little backfocussed relative to the figures.  But this is a nit, it''s a really nice change to see sharpness and clarity with a lot of DOF.</td>', 'Nice diorama.  Wish figures were closer and larger.  Image looks a little backfocussed relative to the figures.  But this is a nit, it''s a really nice change to see sharpness and clarity with a lot of DOF.', '2006-04-08 02:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296795, 314952, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good capture of a moment with faces and expressions, especially the young woman, as you can tell from the guy on the left and the photog guy on the right.  Can guess that this may have been shot from a bike looking back, which would be quite a feat.</td>', 'Good capture of a moment with faces and expressions, especially the young woman, as you can tell from the guy on the left and the photog guy on the right.  Can guess that this may have been shot from a bike looking back, which would be quite a feat.', '2006-04-08 02:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296797, 316183, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, lighting, interesting shadow of the horse.  Might help if you could eliminate the other shadows.  Good title to make me look again and catch a story and the feel.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, lighting, interesting shadow of the horse.  Might help if you could eliminate the other shadows.  Good title to make me look again and catch a story and the feel.', '2006-04-08 02:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296799, 316518, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, sharp, nice DOF, and composition.  Too funny - poor Barbie, but I''m sure that you were able to put her head back on.  Laughed my head off, now if only I can put my head back on...</td>', 'Nice idea, sharp, nice DOF, and composition.  Too funny - poor Barbie, but I''m sure that you were able to put her head back on.  Laughed my head off, now if only I can put my head back on...', '2006-04-08 02:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296803, 316544, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, immediate story tie to Highlander!  Simple, effective, colorful, powerful as that huge sword.  Love it.</td>', 'Nice idea, immediate story tie to Highlander!  Simple, effective, colorful, powerful as that huge sword.  Love it.', '2006-04-08 02:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296808, 316736, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, color.  I think that the crop is just a little too tight -- feels "in-your-face."  I like the image, it''s both striking and touching.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, color.  I think that the crop is just a little too tight -- feels "in-your-face."  I like the image, it''s both striking and touching.', '2006-04-08 02:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296811, 316878, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  But it doesn''t seem very toy-like, I probably wouldn''t know that it is Play-doh if you didnt'' tell me.  It''s still very nice and I like it, but shot from an angle with the Play-doh container as a drink might tie into the challenge better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  But it doesn''t seem very toy-like, I probably wouldn''t know that it is Play-doh if you didnt'' tell me.  It''s still very nice and I like it, but shot from an angle with the Play-doh container as a drink might tie into the challenge better.', '2006-04-08 02:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296812, 316214, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Just too funny with the shades and colored lips -- does a duck have lips? :-)  Made me laugh, and I''m still smiling!</td>', 'Great idea.  Just too funny with the shades and colored lips -- does a duck have lips? :-)  Made me laugh, and I''m still smiling!', '2006-04-08 02:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296813, 314371, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Wish for a touch more DOF for face/eyes.  I like it, especially the feel on the second look.</td>', 'Interesting image.  Wish for a touch more DOF for face/eyes.  I like it, especially the feel on the second look.', '2006-04-08 02:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296815, 314097, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement of rocking horse and carpet, good composition, simple and effective.  I wonder if the rocking horse could use a little more lighting from the front, but the contrast with both the light and dark colors in the carpet seems about right.  Very nice.</td>', 'Nice arrangement of rocking horse and carpet, good composition, simple and effective.  I wonder if the rocking horse could use a little more lighting from the front, but the contrast with both the light and dark colors in the carpet seems about right.  Very nice.', '2006-04-08 02:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296818, 316747, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Emotive and made me look again and feel sad.  Very effective.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Emotive and made me look again and feel sad.  Very effective.', '2006-04-08 02:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296819, 315225, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, and clarity.  Better illumination on rocker would help.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, and clarity.  Better illumination on rocker would help.  I like it.', '2006-04-08 02:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296822, 316798, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely storytelling portrait, good composition, colors, clarity, expressions, faces, eyes.  Love it.</td>', 'Lovely storytelling portrait, good composition, colors, clarity, expressions, faces, eyes.  Love it.', '2006-04-08 02:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296823, 316610, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea and pretty good execution.  Colored bodies might be better, but I love it.  Catchy title.</td>', 'Great idea and pretty good execution.  Colored bodies might be better, but I love it.  Catchy title.', '2006-04-08 02:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296824, 316742, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition, reminds me of the photography of Diane Arbus.  Emotive, tells a story, effective and well done.  Love it.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition, reminds me of the photography of Diane Arbus.  Emotive, tells a story, effective and well done.  Love it.', '2006-04-08 02:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296825, 314785, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, clarity, colors, reflection.  Catchy title and story.  Love it.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, clarity, colors, reflection.  Catchy title and story.  Love it.', '2006-04-08 02:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296826, 316580, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, puppet looking on the theatre scene, colorful.  Chicken wire is a little odd, but that''s a nit.  Love it and hope that it does well.</td>', 'Nice idea, puppet looking on the theatre scene, colorful.  Chicken wire is a little odd, but that''s a nit.  Love it and hope that it does well.', '2006-04-08 02:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296827, 316223, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, composition, position of toy with light on face, color with selective desat, sharpness, and DOF.  Love it and hope it does well.</td>', 'Good idea, composition, position of toy with light on face, color with selective desat, sharpness, and DOF.  Love it and hope it does well.', '2006-04-08 02:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296828, 316617, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, colors.  Extreme DOF is a nice change and very effective to tell the story.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, colors.  Extreme DOF is a nice change and very effective to tell the story.  Well done.', '2006-04-08 02:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296829, 315279, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great expression, lighting, orange bucket, green vine, wetness, even background wall texture.  Pump handle on left is slightly annoying, wish the background were a little simpler.  But it''s wonderful.</td>', 'Great expression, lighting, orange bucket, green vine, wetness, even background wall texture.  Pump handle on left is slightly annoying, wish the background were a little simpler.  But it''s wonderful.', '2006-04-08 02:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296831, 314875, 44490, '<td valign="top">Very interesting angle, composition, color.  I''d prefer cropping out more of the out-of-focus lower foreground, but that''s a nit.  Abstract, yet recognizable.  Love it.</td>', 'Very interesting angle, composition, color.  I''d prefer cropping out more of the out-of-focus lower foreground, but that''s a nit.  Abstract, yet recognizable.  Love it.', '2006-04-08 02:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296832, 313799, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea, definitely not yet another flower shot!  A touch more DOF for the flowers in the foreground might be better.  But it''s wonderful, colorful, interesting combination of shiny and soft textures, fictional and natural.  Love it.</td>', 'Great idea, definitely not yet another flower shot!  A touch more DOF for the flowers in the foreground might be better.  But it''s wonderful, colorful, interesting combination of shiny and soft textures, fictional and natural.  Love it.', '2006-04-08 02:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296833, 315299, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, exposure, backlighting for light background and highlights, DOF, turning of bike and focussed gaze on child.  Couldn''t hardly be better for the light.</td>', 'Nice composition, exposure, backlighting for light background and highlights, DOF, turning of bike and focussed gaze on child.  Couldn''t hardly be better for the light.', '2006-04-08 02:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296834, 316630, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice panning shot, composition, sharp, colorful, nice eye contact, cute.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice panning shot, composition, sharp, colorful, nice eye contact, cute.  Well done.', '2006-04-08 02:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296835, 315478, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, colorful.  Looks like a real beach - good shot either way.  Nice combinations of natural and man-made.  Man figure would probably be better out of the shadow, but that''s a nit.  Love it, and hope that it does well.</td>', 'Nice idea, colorful.  Looks like a real beach - good shot either way.  Nice combinations of natural and man-made.  Man figure would probably be better out of the shadow, but that''s a nit.  Love it, and hope that it does well.', '2006-04-08 02:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296950, 316385, 53668, '<td valign="top">FULL points!  Interesting, creative, and well photographed.</td>', 'FULL points!  Interesting, creative, and well photographed.', '2006-04-08 03:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296954, 313408, 53668, '<td valign="top">great story-telling image.  Creative.</td>', 'great story-telling image.  Creative.', '2006-04-08 03:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296965, 315279, 53668, '<td valign="top">High Impact photo.  Lighting is very good.  <br/>Kids can spend all day playing with water.  Subject matter very appropriate...children don''t need a fancy toy to ''play''.  In this case, water is the toy.</td>', 'High Impact photo.  Lighting is very good.  Kids can spend all day playing with water.  Subject matter very appropriate...children don''t need a fancy toy to ''play''.  In this case, water is the toy.', '2006-04-08 03:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296966, 316910, 53668, '<td valign="top">lol!  Great set-up!</td>', 'lol!  Great set-up!', '2006-04-08 03:33:10.000000', NULL, 1);
