(2296984, 316810, 53668, '<td valign="top">funny, cute as heck, creative and no ''troll scores'' for this one.  9</td>', 'funny, cute as heck, creative and no ''troll scores'' for this one.  9', '2006-04-08 03:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
