(2297381, 316511, 51533, '<td valign="top">I like the ideea and it looks carefully composed; you should work on the lighting part, that camera flash just ruins the image. studio lights are a bit complicated but far a small and still composition like that the light of a desk lamp and a tripod for the camera would work; or you could have used some soft natural light from a window. good luck</td>', 'I like the ideea and it looks carefully composed; you should work on the lighting part, that camera flash just ruins the image. studio lights are a bit complicated but far a small and still composition like that the light of a desk lamp and a tripod for the camera would work; or you could have used some soft natural light from a window. good luck', '2006-04-08 11:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
