(2302799, 314840, 29011, '<td valign="top">Like a dream. Reminds of the scene from the movie, Eternal Sunshine of The Spotless Mind. Where the two grownup main character appear playing their young selves in a childhood memory.</td>', 'Like a dream. Reminds of the scene from the movie, Eternal Sunshine of The Spotless Mind. Where the two grownup main character appear playing their young selves in a childhood memory.', '2006-04-11 00:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
