(2305546, 315147, 37893, '<td valign="top">Ah Manny! Now I see what you mean. This is still a great image though and a break from your "Librodo style". I ma glad to see this. The score doesn''t do it justice. It seems it''s too low compared to other shots. Everyone wins in this challenge kabayan ;)</td>', 'Ah Manny! Now I see what you mean. This is still a great image though and a break from your "Librodo style". I ma glad to see this. The score doesn''t do it justice. It seems it''s too low compared to other shots. Everyone wins in this challenge kabayan ;)', '2006-04-12 03:04:17.000000', NULL, 0),
