(2305876, 315677, 15266, '<td valign="top">Its a good shot and 60th out of 300 is nothing to scoff at.  They can''t all win. Seriously, I don''t see any "flaws" in your image, apparently it just didn''t have the emotional pull that the top shots had. Personally, I think its adorable, but in a challenge full of adorable shots......  you did very well.</td>', 'Its a good shot and 60th out of 300 is nothing to scoff at.  They can''t all win. Seriously, I don''t see any "flaws" in your image, apparently it just didn''t have the emotional pull that the top shots had. Personally, I think its adorable, but in a challenge full of adorable shots......  you did very well.', '2006-04-12 07:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
