(2306003, 316281, 29009, '<td valign="top">Hi Matt!  What a little cutie your little boy is - a natural in front of the camera.  This was a good idea, but I think the black background hurt you a little bit, because it has more of a colder feel to it than I might expect for "bedtime story-time."  Exposure seems to just a little bit off, too, as the black of Mickey''s ears are getting lost in the background as well.  Great facial expression on your son - you can tell he''s having fun reading the story to his "friends."</td>', 'Hi Matt!  What a little cutie your little boy is - a natural in front of the camera.  This was a good idea, but I think the black background hurt you a little bit, because it has more of a colder feel to it than I might expect for "bedtime story-time."  Exposure seems to just a little bit off, too, as the black of Mickey''s ears are getting lost in the background as well.  Great facial expression on your son - you can tell he''s having fun reading the story to his "friends."', '2006-04-12 08:09:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2306040, 316627, 7889, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, much appreciated. Also a big thank you to Marius for chosing this as a favourite, really made my day.<br/> <br/>These were originally colourful childs building bricks but I tweaked the colours. Obviously not many people liked it!!<br/>never mind.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-12 07:17:41.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments, much appreciated. Also a big thank you to Marius for chosing this as a favourite, really made my day. These were originally colourful childs building bricks but I tweaked the colours. Obviously not many people liked it!!never mind. Mike', '2006-04-12 08:16:02.000000', '2006-04-12 08:17:41.000000', 0),
