(2306622, 316828, 33560, '<td valign="top">There is a commonly held myth of something good that ''more is better.''  This photo manages to turn that myth on its head.  For a year or so I have found the rubber duck to be one of the most photographically unsatisfying objects of common use on this site.  I have viewed it as some do litter.  Here, however, by duplicating it a hundred times over you have diminished its ills accordingly and you have magically redeemed the object.  Nice photo.  Good Job.</td>', 'There is a commonly held myth of something good that ''more is better.''  This photo manages to turn that myth on its head.  For a year or so I have found the rubber duck to be one of the most photographically unsatisfying objects of common use on this site.  I have viewed it as some do litter.  Here, however, by duplicating it a hundred times over you have diminished its ills accordingly and you have magically redeemed the object.  Nice photo.  Good Job.', '2006-04-12 11:58:33.000000', NULL, 0),
