(2313743, 315843, 34938, '<td valign="top">Mary this girl is cute, but there are a few issues here...the yellow cast has already been commented on. You can adjust this in your image editing software. The focus isn''t strong, the whole shot is quite blurry. It''s a pity, because this shot is so cute and the composition is good. I am sure that those two things alone would have made for a higher score. You got 61 x 5''s. Had that been 61x 6''s with those two things corrected, you might have finished in the top 20%.<br/> <br/>Keep going. I would do as much as I could to utilise this gorgeous ittle model in future challenges...she''s adorable!</td>', 'Mary this girl is cute, but there are a few issues here...the yellow cast has already been commented on. You can adjust this in your image editing software. The focus isn''t strong, the whole shot is quite blurry. It''s a pity, because this shot is so cute and the composition is good. I am sure that those two things alone would have made for a higher score. You got 61 x 5''s. Had that been 61x 6''s with those two things corrected, you might have finished in the top 20%. Keep going. I would do as much as I could to utilise this gorgeous ittle model in future challenges...she''s adorable!', '2006-04-15 05:56:11.000000', NULL, 0),
