(2319096, 316599, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>First Impression:<br/>Cute shot! Lots of blown white! Nice lighting on the toys.<br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>Good subjects and a very creative activity. I found all the white distracting. Crop may have been a little tight, but not a problem.<br/> <br/>Subject:<br/>Meets challenge well. Some voters may not have cared for the title. <br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>Focus is good, but I think the DOF is a bit shallow. I would have preferred to see more of the toys in focus.<br/> <br/>Summary:<br/>Humorous shot, technically solid, but the white space takes away the wow factor.<br/></td>', 'Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club. First Impression:Cute shot! Lots of blown white! Nice lighting on the toys. Composition:Good subjects and a very creative activity. I found all the white distracting. Crop may have been a little tight, but not a problem. Subject:Meets challenge well. Some voters may not have cared for the title.  Technical:Focus is good, but I think the DOF is a bit shallow. I would have preferred to see more of the toys in focus. Summary:Humorous shot, technically solid, but the white space takes away the wow factor.', '2006-04-17 13:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
