(2413010, 316223, 55822, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. You really have a great sense of humor and it shows in this image. Good composition, DOF, everything just comes together cleanly in here. Good job.</td>', 'I love this shot. You really have a great sense of humor and it shows in this image. Good composition, DOF, everything just comes together cleanly in here. Good job.', '2006-05-13 22:30:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2413338, 313850, 36628, '<td valign="top">I thought the tilt was weird at first, but its growing on me. I think it works pretty well with the way the bear is resting. I would like to see, though the sideing a bit more bright/white. I think it would really make the shot pop out a lot more.</td>', 'I thought the tilt was weird at first, but its growing on me. I think it works pretty well with the way the bear is resting. I would like to see, though the sideing a bit more bright/white. I think it would really make the shot pop out a lot more.', '2006-05-14 01:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2428728, 316558, 16241, '<td valign="top">i like this!</td>', 'i like this!', '2006-05-18 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2439738, 316558, 36470, '<td valign="top">As I get tired of people ''abusing'' selective desat, it''s always nice to come across an image that uses it wisely as you have done here.  Your choice for selective desat are perfect here and adds to the mood of the photo.  I like that the red is toned down a bit as well.  Excellent :)</td>', 'As I get tired of people ''abusing'' selective desat, it''s always nice to come across an image that uses it wisely as you have done here.  Your choice for selective desat are perfect here and adds to the mood of the photo.  I like that the red is toned down a bit as well.  Excellent :)', '2006-05-20 09:42:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2538587, 316223, 37893, '<td valign="top">The desat really works for this image as my attention is immediately drawn to the toy. It fits the challenge well and finished great! Congrats on this shot!</td>', 'The desat really works for this image as my attention is immediately drawn to the toy. It fits the challenge well and finished great! Congrats on this shot!', '2006-06-21 22:00:21.000000', NULL, 0),
