(2622823, 313794, 55738, '<td valign="top">I''m curious about why you converted to B&amp;W.  My memories of this guy are of vibrant crazy colors.  Maybe that''s part of why it didn''t score as well as you had hoped.</td>', 'I''m curious about why you converted to B&W.  My memories of this guy are of vibrant crazy colors.  Maybe that''s part of why it didn''t score as well as you had hoped.', '2006-07-14 16:49:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2634713, 314785, 36470, '<td valign="top">Did you ever have a pic that you looked at a million times and never commented?  LOL  I love this picture.  The colors are very vivid at give it a storybook like feel.  Well deserved blue, congrats!</td>', 'Did you ever have a pic that you looked at a million times and never commented?  LOL  I love this picture.  The colors are very vivid at give it a storybook like feel.  Well deserved blue, congrats!', '2006-07-19 00:31:26.000000', NULL, 0),
