(2786583, 316223, 59754, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why but I find this picture hilarious.  It''s very dramatic and well done, and at the same time it reminds me of how as a little one I used to take toys as "the real thing", and would try to imitate reality with them.</td>', 'I''m not sure why but I find this picture hilarious.  It''s very dramatic and well done, and at the same time it reminds me of how as a little one I used to take toys as "the real thing", and would try to imitate reality with them.', '2006-09-02 02:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
