(3036572, 316544, 22537, '<td valign="top">Alright, the dude''s colors are all wrong.  Like dont you watch America''s top model or what?? Buddy, the headless guy has this like thing stuck on top of his head and he''s well.....yellow.  Like Ick! All it says to me is anger and that certainly does not make me want to dance.  You really gotta try harder or get like a Moped or something.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'Alright, the dude''s colors are all wrong.  Like dont you watch America''s top model or what?? Buddy, the headless guy has this like thing stuck on top of his head and he''s well.....yellow.  Like Ick! All it says to me is anger and that certainly does not make me want to dance.  You really gotta try harder or get like a Moped or something.  Hope that helps.', '2006-11-16 02:10:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3063800, 316729, 46177, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here, nice lighting.  Haven''t seen this one before but certainly hope you will be entering more challenges and add to your portfolio.</td>', 'I like what you did here, nice lighting.  Haven''t seen this one before but certainly hope you will be entering more challenges and add to your portfolio.', '2006-11-26 20:26:08.000000', NULL, 0),
