(4010068, 316692, 14986, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective results for this shot!  Great idea and the clarity, colors and dof really make it work.</td>', 'Simple yet effective results for this shot!  Great idea and the clarity, colors and dof really make it work.', '2007-08-18 23:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230129, 316558, 32872, '<td valign="top">Hi!!  I was looking at your portfolio because we have similar images with the exact same title...your''s came first and I PROMISE you I had no idea this wonderful image existed or I would have named my image something else.  Sorry, but it was an honest mistake anad btw...your image is far better than my Forgotten image!!<br/> <br/>:)<br/></td>', 'Hi!!  I was looking at your portfolio because we have similar images with the exact same title...your''s came first and I PROMISE you I had no idea this wonderful image existed or I would have named my image something else.  Sorry, but it was an honest mistake anad btw...your image is far better than my Forgotten image!! :)', '2007-11-07 21:34:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230415, 314785, 43463, '<td valign="top">This composition has lovely vivid colors in the wooded greens that is a perfect complementary setting for this lone hunting bear. Only this bear is not the wild, untamed bear found in a natural woodland setting but a cute, cuddly ''domesticated'' teddy bear. His pose at the water''s edge looking into the reflective surface of the water in search for salmon is akin to his wild, untamed cousins - the black and brown bears. Because this bear is not of the ferocious kind there presence in the wild is endangered because the cute, cuddly nature has most observers walk right on up, pick them up, hug them, squeeze them, call them George and take them right home:-) Lighting, focus, and composition all all excellent in this photo. Great job.</td>', 'This composition has lovely vivid colors in the wooded greens that is a perfect complementary setting for this lone hunting bear. Only this bear is not the wild, untamed bear found in a natural woodland setting but a cute, cuddly ''domesticated'' teddy bear. His pose at the water''s edge looking into the reflective surface of the water in search for salmon is akin to his wild, untamed cousins - the black and brown bears. Because this bear is not of the ferocious kind there presence in the wild is endangered because the cute, cuddly nature has most observers walk right on up, pick them up, hug them, squeeze them, call them George and take them right home:-) Lighting, focus, and composition all all excellent in this photo. Great job.', '2007-11-07 22:41:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4597936, 314785, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is a very cute shot.  Well deserved win.  Love the composition and the reflection is perfect.<br/></td>', 'This is a very cute shot.  Well deserved win.  Love the composition and the reflection is perfect.', '2008-03-31 01:55:33.000000', NULL, 0),
